'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page two of the [[Masters of Ceremony Premium Warbond#Page 2|Masters of Ceremony]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and 45 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

